WEBVTT

00:01:44.117 --> 00:01:45.880
I'm leaving!

00:01:53.193 --> 00:01:57.163
Oh, Tenchi, isn't it so nice.

00:01:57.163 --> 00:01:59.495
It's like a carnival every day.

00:02:00.967 --> 00:02:06.837
I wish the days could go on just
like this forever and ever, Tenchi.

00:02:29.696 --> 00:02:33.566
The days of hoopla we
thought would go on forever...

00:02:33.566 --> 00:02:35.727
The never-ending carnival.

00:02:36.302 --> 00:02:39.169
It all started then.

00:03:19.245 --> 00:03:22.078
Wh-What's that?

00:03:31.324 --> 00:03:35.124
I'm quite sure it landed
somewhere around here.

00:03:36.362 --> 00:03:38.387
What's that?

00:03:48.575 --> 00:03:50.677
Hey! Are you all right?

00:03:50.677 --> 00:03:52.668
Come on!

00:03:54.814 --> 00:03:56.583
S-Smell of alcohol?

00:03:56.583 --> 00:03:58.813
Yes! Water!

00:04:06.025 --> 00:04:07.925
Oh, good.

00:04:08.962 --> 00:04:12.565
Uh... Are you hurt?

00:04:12.565 --> 00:04:15.468
No. Who are you?

00:04:15.468 --> 00:04:17.704
Oh, my name is Tenchi Masaki.

00:04:17.704 --> 00:04:21.341
What on earth is this?

00:04:21.341 --> 00:04:23.443
Oh! I'm so scared!

00:04:23.443 --> 00:04:24.611
I am Ryoko!

00:04:24.611 --> 00:04:26.546
A space pirate is at my heels!

00:04:26.546 --> 00:04:28.681
Please! I beg you! Help me!

00:04:28.681 --> 00:04:32.014
W-Wait a minute. I don't understand!

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:34.621
What?

00:04:34.621 --> 00:04:36.389
I'm so scared!

00:04:36.389 --> 00:04:37.824
H-Hey!

00:04:37.824 --> 00:04:40.493
Please! I beg you! Save me!

00:04:40.493 --> 00:04:42.358
Hey! Uh... Huh?

00:04:47.767 --> 00:04:50.470
That's the one! That's the space pirate!

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:53.166
But I don't understand!

00:04:54.307 --> 00:04:55.797
Oops!

00:04:57.577 --> 00:04:59.272
Let's get out of here!

00:05:17.196 --> 00:05:21.394
Why? Why should I be
in this kind of trouble?!

00:05:30.176 --> 00:05:34.613
Long-distance commuting
is fine, but this is a bit too much.

00:05:41.854 --> 00:05:44.823
Ah! A dead end! What am I gonna do?!

00:05:46.592 --> 00:05:50.196
Hey! What do you say? Hey, tell me!

00:05:50.196 --> 00:05:52.465
P-Please listen to me!

00:05:52.465 --> 00:05:54.400
I don't have a clue what your problem is,

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:55.835
but I'm sure you can
solve it in a less rough way.

00:05:55.835 --> 00:06:00.573
Y-You see, we can understand each other
better if we take time and talk it all out.

00:06:00.573 --> 00:06:03.409
No! He is a savage criminal!

00:06:03.409 --> 00:06:05.011
It's no use trying to talk with him!

00:06:05.011 --> 00:06:06.679
It can't be.

00:06:06.679 --> 00:06:09.549
This is the destiny we two must share.

00:06:09.549 --> 00:06:12.518
We promised to die together, remember?

00:06:12.518 --> 00:06:14.687
No, I don't remember
making such a promise!

00:06:14.687 --> 00:06:17.087
We'll become bright stars
in the sky together, you and I.

00:06:17.924 --> 00:06:19.915
You gotta be kidding!

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:36.542
Well, he seems unable
to get up, doesn't he?

00:06:36.542 --> 00:06:38.100
He sure does.

00:06:54.694 --> 00:06:55.995
We can go now.

00:06:55.995 --> 00:06:57.394
Uh, yeah.

00:07:01.968 --> 00:07:03.269
Hey, Nobuyuki.

00:07:03.269 --> 00:07:04.937
What is it, Father?

00:07:04.937 --> 00:07:09.075
Tenchi is very late
coming home today, isn't he?

00:07:09.075 --> 00:07:11.644
Well, he must be busy picking up
girls on the street or something.

00:07:11.644 --> 00:07:14.738
No. He is not like you!

00:07:15.648 --> 00:07:18.082
You're tough on me, aren't you, Father?

00:07:19.152 --> 00:07:23.089
Well, it's true he has been
loosening up a bit too much these days.

00:07:23.089 --> 00:07:25.992
Maybe I should scold him this time.

00:07:25.992 --> 00:07:28.153
Oh. It sounds like he's come home.

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:34.000
Where have you been
hanging around so late at night?

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:36.836
Hanging out late at night is the first
step towards juvenile delinquency...

00:07:36.836 --> 00:07:38.326
Huh?

00:07:40.072 --> 00:07:41.903
Hi.

00:07:44.043 --> 00:07:46.511
Who is the beautiful
young lady you have with you?

00:07:50.183 --> 00:07:51.918
Hmm. You seem to be quite upset.

00:07:51.918 --> 00:07:54.387
Have you two eloped or something?

00:07:54.387 --> 00:07:56.088
Oh, how did you know?

00:07:56.088 --> 00:07:58.691
I would do no such thing!

00:07:58.691 --> 00:08:02.061
Then what is this all about?

00:08:02.061 --> 00:08:03.563
So you are an extraterrestrial?!

00:08:03.563 --> 00:08:08.601
Yes. I was attacked by a savage
space pirate on my journey.

00:08:08.601 --> 00:08:12.705
I desperately tried to escape,
but my spaceship got very close

00:08:12.705 --> 00:08:15.508
to running into another ship and
fell straight down to the planet below.

00:08:15.508 --> 00:08:19.672
You don't expect ordinary
people like us to believe such a story!

00:08:22.181 --> 00:08:26.486
You went through a great
hardship, young lady from space.

00:08:26.486 --> 00:08:28.750
You poor thing.

00:08:30.556 --> 00:08:31.424
Hey, Tenchi!

00:08:31.424 --> 00:08:32.692
Don't just stand there!

00:08:32.692 --> 00:08:34.627
Why don't you offer her
nice sweets or something?!

00:08:34.627 --> 00:08:36.028
Wait a minute!

00:08:36.028 --> 00:08:39.065
How can you believe her story so easily?

00:08:39.065 --> 00:08:41.133
I find her story much more believable

00:08:41.133 --> 00:08:44.537
than a story of you
picking up such a pretty girl.

00:08:44.537 --> 00:08:45.705
Oh, I see.

00:08:45.705 --> 00:08:49.242
It must be very cold in
outer space this time of year.

00:08:49.242 --> 00:08:52.011
Here. Have some more hot tea, please.

00:08:52.011 --> 00:08:56.749
Oh, how sweet of you to talk so
kindly to a total stranger from space.

00:08:56.749 --> 00:09:01.654
But if I stay here, it will
only mean trouble for you.

00:09:01.654 --> 00:09:06.826
He, that space pirate,
will come back for me. I'm sure of it.

00:09:06.826 --> 00:09:10.730
Be assured, young lady!
We are on your side.

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:11.697
But...

00:09:11.697 --> 00:09:15.034
Don't you worry about anything now.
We will protect you, I promise.

00:09:15.034 --> 00:09:17.169
Thank you so very much, Honorable Father!

00:09:17.169 --> 00:09:20.373
You call me father?

00:09:20.373 --> 00:09:23.171
Yes. I'll be your devoted daughter!

00:09:24.010 --> 00:09:26.612
Oh, Tenchi, you got
yourself a wonderful bride.

00:09:26.612 --> 00:09:32.051
- What?!
- Your mother in heaven
must be happy for you now.

00:09:32.051 --> 00:09:34.020
Father!

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:35.715
My daughter!

00:10:14.493 --> 00:10:19.532
Really! It may work against
typhoons but not against space pirates.

00:10:19.532 --> 00:10:22.969
I think we're wasting our time.

00:10:22.969 --> 00:10:24.904
Stop grumbling and work harder!

00:10:24.904 --> 00:10:28.708
Don't you know the saying "The price
of pleasure is eternal vigilance"?

00:10:28.708 --> 00:10:32.211
Well, I think I'll be going
back to the shrine now.

00:10:32.211 --> 00:10:34.146
Call me if anything happens.

00:10:34.146 --> 00:10:36.816
Oh, good night, Grandpa.

00:10:36.816 --> 00:10:38.718
Maybe we should get back inside now.

00:10:38.718 --> 00:10:40.208
Yeah.

00:10:44.123 --> 00:10:47.259
Oh! I'm scared!

00:10:47.259 --> 00:10:52.561
Don't you worry tonight. I will
stand guard all night and protect you.

00:10:59.572 --> 00:11:05.611
Yes! There! Come on!
Good! One more. Oh, close!

00:11:05.611 --> 00:11:11.751
Yes! There! There! That's it!
Oh! No! No! No!

00:11:11.751 --> 00:11:12.852
What are you doing?

00:11:12.852 --> 00:11:14.286
I'm moving to the next room.

00:11:14.286 --> 00:11:15.421
Why?

00:11:15.421 --> 00:11:18.791
Because I can't do my
homework with all this noise!

00:11:18.791 --> 00:11:22.028
Ah! You aren't abandoning me, are you?!

00:11:22.028 --> 00:11:23.195
Hey! Let me go!

00:11:23.195 --> 00:11:26.332
Don't go! Please don't leave me!

00:11:26.332 --> 00:11:28.567
What are you talking about?

00:11:28.567 --> 00:11:32.004
Well, you see, Tenchi...

00:11:32.004 --> 00:11:33.665
Let me go!

00:11:38.277 --> 00:11:39.767
Yes?

00:11:48.688 --> 00:11:50.456
H-H-He's here!

00:11:50.456 --> 00:11:53.292
Ooh! And I was just
about to get a good one.

00:11:53.292 --> 00:11:56.162
Who could it be to visit us so late at night?

00:11:56.162 --> 00:11:58.431
You fool! It's the space pirate!

00:11:58.431 --> 00:12:00.666
Oh! That's right. That's right.

00:12:00.666 --> 00:12:04.329
Hey! You'd forgotten about him?!

00:12:33.699 --> 00:12:35.468
We're going this way!

00:12:35.468 --> 00:12:37.265
Where? Which way?

00:12:56.889 --> 00:12:59.551
What's all this noise in the
middle of the night about?

00:13:00.426 --> 00:13:02.485
Grandpa!

00:13:11.837 --> 00:13:13.998
What a nuisance.

00:13:19.545 --> 00:13:20.579
Grandpa!

00:13:20.579 --> 00:13:22.479
Just leave it to me!

00:13:45.738 --> 00:13:47.039
Cool!

00:13:47.039 --> 00:13:49.269
Great, Grandpa!

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:01.353
Surrender yourself, space pirate Ryoko!

00:14:01.353 --> 00:14:03.155
Your evil deeds should end here and now!

00:14:03.155 --> 00:14:05.724
What? Hey, wait a minute.

00:14:05.724 --> 00:14:08.427
I thought you were the space pirate!

00:14:08.427 --> 00:14:12.064
I am First Class Detective
Mihoshi from the Galaxy Police!

00:14:12.064 --> 00:14:14.600
I've come a long way to
this planet in pursuit of Ryoko,

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.869
the infamous criminal
wanted throughout the universe.

00:14:16.869 --> 00:14:20.635
She's lying! Do I look like a naughty girl?!

00:14:21.373 --> 00:14:24.610
So you're suspecting me
even though there is no proof!

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:26.846
There is proof, all right!

00:14:26.846 --> 00:14:31.250
This is it! Oh, no, it's not.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:33.185
Here! This one! No!
This is not the one, either.

00:14:33.185 --> 00:14:35.254
Oh, where is it now?

00:14:35.254 --> 00:14:36.889
Not this one.

00:14:36.889 --> 00:14:39.949
Well! It's strange.

00:14:41.293 --> 00:14:43.662
I forgot...

00:14:43.662 --> 00:14:45.527
There! I found it!

00:14:45.631 --> 00:14:47.833
Upsy-daisy!

00:14:47.833 --> 00:14:49.134
Here!

00:14:49.134 --> 00:14:52.103
Here is my I.D.

00:14:54.907 --> 00:14:58.741
And see? This is a wanted notice!

00:15:04.783 --> 00:15:07.319
I guess you know who I really am now.

00:15:07.319 --> 00:15:12.224
You see, I had this terrible hangover
when I ran into this stupid cop.

00:15:12.224 --> 00:15:16.829
Otherwise, I would've never, ever
made a mistake like that, no, not me.

00:15:16.829 --> 00:15:20.390
Well, now how should I cook you?

00:15:23.202 --> 00:15:25.504
D-Don't move, please.

00:15:25.504 --> 00:15:29.406
Or l-I'll shoot you. It'll hurt if you're shot!

00:15:31.143 --> 00:15:33.111
Go ahead and try.

00:15:47.793 --> 00:15:48.894
I told you so.

00:15:48.894 --> 00:15:52.464
I am too big a game for
a lowly hunter like you!

00:15:52.464 --> 00:15:56.264
Now it's time for retaliation,
and plenty of it, too.

00:16:03.042 --> 00:16:05.978
You can't escape me!

00:16:05.978 --> 00:16:09.106
It turned out to be
quite a noisy event, indeed.

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:23.429
Hey, can't you do anything about this?

00:16:23.429 --> 00:16:25.097
You're a cop, aren't you?!

00:16:25.097 --> 00:16:27.895
Well, yes, I am, but...

00:16:30.502 --> 00:16:32.204
I'm scared!

00:16:32.204 --> 00:16:33.831
She's no good!

00:16:40.813 --> 00:16:42.147
- Ouch!
- Hurry!

00:16:42.147 --> 00:16:44.775
Wait! I can't stand up!

00:16:48.854 --> 00:16:51.256
Well, prepare to die now!

00:16:51.256 --> 00:16:53.087
Shit!

00:16:56.962 --> 00:16:59.260
Come on! I'm ready!

00:17:25.858 --> 00:17:28.258
Oh! It's been fun, really!

00:17:29.628 --> 00:17:33.232
I never meant to harm you at all.

00:17:33.232 --> 00:17:35.234
You see, I was just teasing you.

00:17:35.234 --> 00:17:38.470
So you are going to surrender yourself?

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:41.640
Well, I just might do that for you.

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:45.167
Just a second. I'll read you your rights first.

00:17:46.512 --> 00:17:54.453
"Galaxy Federal Police Law, article 2546,
page 937 of the revised divisions.

00:17:54.453 --> 00:17:56.321
A suspect is entitled to
keep silent about any facts

00:17:56.321 --> 00:18:00.189
which may have inadvertent impacts
on him/her and to demand a lawyer..."

00:18:01.093 --> 00:18:03.562
Aah!

00:18:03.562 --> 00:18:04.596
And?

00:18:04.596 --> 00:18:07.066
L-I think I know the rights by heart.

00:18:07.066 --> 00:18:13.172
Well, Galaxy Federal
Police Law, article 2564... Oops.

00:18:13.172 --> 00:18:17.843
Was it article 2456 or 2654?

00:18:17.843 --> 00:18:22.648
No, no. 2464. No, that's not it!

00:18:22.648 --> 00:18:25.050
Ooh! What shall I do?!

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:27.419
2446? No!

00:18:27.419 --> 00:18:30.722
I'm just getting more confused!

00:18:30.722 --> 00:18:33.625
Well, now I kind of like this
place very much somehow.

00:18:33.625 --> 00:18:36.428
Maybe I should do you a
favor and stay here for a while.

00:18:36.428 --> 00:18:38.263
What?!

00:18:38.263 --> 00:18:40.299
You're happy, aren't you?

00:18:40.299 --> 00:18:41.767
Don't be silly!

00:18:41.767 --> 00:18:47.103
When you first saved me,
you were really valiant.

00:19:00.719 --> 00:19:04.957
Ohhh! I had so much fun last night.

00:19:04.957 --> 00:19:08.552
And so much nuisance for me, indeed!

00:19:09.561 --> 00:19:12.331
I love these pickles!

00:19:12.331 --> 00:19:14.466
A special recipe from my late wife.

00:19:14.466 --> 00:19:16.668
Go ahead. Have some more.

00:19:16.668 --> 00:19:19.404
Wow! Thank you.

00:19:19.404 --> 00:19:22.241
Hey! How come you're
eating breakfast with us?

00:19:22.241 --> 00:19:23.542
You have some nerve.

00:19:23.542 --> 00:19:25.942
Doesn't that apply to you, too?

00:19:28.347 --> 00:19:29.748
I'm sorry.

00:19:29.748 --> 00:19:35.914
My spaceship is destroyed,
and I have no place to go home to.

00:19:37.456 --> 00:19:39.892
Oh, no. Now, now, don't cry.

00:19:39.892 --> 00:19:45.421
It's too bad, especially now that
I've decided to surrender myself to you.

00:19:46.798 --> 00:19:50.102
Galaxy Federal Police Law, article 2500...

00:19:50.102 --> 00:19:52.263
No! I can't remember!

00:19:55.641 --> 00:19:57.943
So what are you gonna do now?

00:19:57.943 --> 00:20:01.413
Would you please let
me stay here for a while?

00:20:01.413 --> 00:20:05.349
I don't know anyone else on this planet.

00:20:06.118 --> 00:20:07.753
Mmm. That's a good idea.

00:20:07.753 --> 00:20:12.713
Wow! It'll brighten our lives to
have you girls in this bachelor family.

00:20:14.259 --> 00:20:18.964
Well, I have another favor to ask.

00:20:18.964 --> 00:20:20.532
What is it?

00:20:20.532 --> 00:20:23.899
Can I have another bowl of steamed rice?

00:20:37.449 --> 00:20:39.885
So here you are, Tenchi.

00:20:39.885 --> 00:20:42.788
Who do you think is responsible for all this?

00:20:42.788 --> 00:20:45.157
Don't bother yourself with such trivial tasks.

00:20:45.157 --> 00:20:45.857
Really!

00:20:45.857 --> 00:20:48.193
Are you really going to stay here with us?

00:20:48.193 --> 00:20:50.896
Oh, I will, if it makes you happy.

00:20:50.896 --> 00:20:52.625
Hey...

00:20:54.433 --> 00:20:56.594
No need for discussions.

00:22:58.123 --> 00:23:00.225
As you saw, the groundswell has begun!

00:23:00.225 --> 00:23:04.096
The third home invader
who's gonna appear next is...

00:23:04.096 --> 00:23:05.697
Wow! What a surprise!

00:23:05.697 --> 00:23:08.633
The most famous princess
in the entire universe!

00:23:08.633 --> 00:23:11.269
But somehow she has
some bad blood with Ryoko,

00:23:11.269 --> 00:23:14.639
so they start fighting each other in space!

00:23:14.639 --> 00:23:16.708
Next episode is: "No Need for Princesses!"

00:23:16.708 --> 00:23:19.878
A nice and cool vacation for the princess.

00:23:19.878 --> 00:23:22.676
Unquestionably fun!
